<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11512" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπαρ-έγκλῐτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>direct,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				<u>UP</u>
				15.8
			</span></i>; <i>inflexible,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νόμοι φυσικοὶ ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nicom.
					<u>Ar.</u>
					1.23
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρόνοια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hero
				</span></i>
			
			<i>*Deff.</i><i><span class="en">
				136.57
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>straight,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐθεῖα</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γραμμή</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Phlp.
				<u>in Mete.</u>
				21.10
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ammon.
				<u>in Porph.</u>
				9.1
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					18(2).726
				</span></i>
			; <i>not diverging from the perpendicular,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Eustr.
				<u>in EN</u>
				74.9
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>unimpaired,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑγίεια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Iamb.
					<u>VP</u>
					3.13
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
